      "evidenceText": "Maps Mania Skip to main content Posts Featured November 27, 2026 Mapping the Wind with Planes The Flights in the Air Right Now map from Tailodds displays two things: the live positions of aircraft flying over the United States and the wind conditions at cruising altitude. There are plenty of maps showing the real-time positions of commercial aircraft, but this one puts that flight data to an ingenious additional use. What differentiates the Tailodds map from FlightRadar24 and FlightAware is that the wind conditions on this map don't come from a weather service but are inferred from the aircraft themselves.  The wind conditions on Flights in the Air Right Now are calculated by comparing the direction an aircraft is pointing (its heading) with the direction it is actually travelling (its ground track). Because aircraft have to compensate for wind, these two directions aren't necessarily the same. When flying across a crosswind, for example, a pilot will point the nose slightly into the wind to maintain the intended flight path. This is known as 'crabbing'. By... Share Get link Facebook X Pinterest Email Other Apps Post a Comment Read more Latest Posts November 26, 2026 Mapping the Iowa Lead Explosion Share Get link Facebook X Pinterest Email Other Apps Post a Comment November 25, 2026 Google Maps Snow Globes Share Get link Facebook X Pinterest Email Other Apps Post a Comment November 24, 2026 A Train Ride in Three.js Share Get link Facebook X Pinterest Email Other Apps Post a Comment November 24, 2026 Real World Racing Share Get link Facebook X Pinterest Email Other Apps Post a Comment November 23, 2026 Turn Any Location into a Hand-Drawn Map Share Get link Facebook X Pinterest Email Other Apps Post a Comment November 21, 2026 Search the Planet with AI Share Get link Facebook X Pinterest Email Other Apps Post a Comment November 20, 2026 Madrid's Architectural Time Machine Share Get link Facebook X Pinterest Email Other Apps Post a Comment Novemb